+++ b/bolt/test/ARM/cortex-m-handler-fop-state-input-equivalence.s
@@ -0,0 +1,97 @@
+## Handler FOP may feed architectural state only under the separately named
+## private-stack/no-asynchronous-memory-observer contract, and only when the
+## FOP proof is an adjacent same-register store/reload represented by a
+## retained self move. A different destination and an EXC_RETURN input remain
+## rejected.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv7m-none-eabi -mcpu=cortex-m3 \
+# RUN:   %s -o %t.o
