index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..5f59dfd2f4ab09330090202780c222eadbe54db7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/bolt/test/ARM/cortex-m-v8-profiles.s
@@ -0,0 +1,211 @@
+## Qualify every Cortex-M CPU in the pinned LLVM target across the M-profile
+## Armv8 generations. Ordinary code may use the audited native pipeline;
+## TrustZone transition/gateway code is decoded but retained as an opaque
+## semantic unit on M33/M35P; MVE integer and floating-point instructions are
+## decoded and exactly re-emitted on M52/M55; PACBTI-M instructions are decoded
+## and retained as an opaque function on M52/M85.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv8m.base-none-eabi \
