+# CAPACITY: BOLT-ERROR: 'cannot rebuild ARM EHABI index tables': ARM EHABI index .ARM.exidx needs 0x20 bytes after fragment layout but has only 0x19 bytes of exact linked capacity
+# BOLT: BOLT-INFO: basic block reordering modified layout of 1 functions
