+## BOLT loop inversion is target-generic machinery, but it changes physical
+## control-flow layout and the executed branch sequence.  Firm-BOLT therefore
+## requires an explicit Cortex-M contract and publishes exact instruction
+## origins after compact in-place emission.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv7m-none-eabi -mcpu=cortex-m3 \
+# RUN:   %s -o %t.o
+# RUN: ld.lld --emit-relocs -Ttext=0x08000000 -e Reset_Handler %t.o -o %t.exe
